<ul>
  <li><strong>Title:</strong> <%= @bug.title %></li>
  <li><strong>Type:</strong> <%= @bug.bug_type %></li>
  <li><strong>Deadline:</strong> <%= @bug.deadline %></li>
  <li><strong>Status:</strong> <%= @bug.status %></li>
</ul>
<p>Please log in to the Bug Tracking System to review it.</p>
